From 3080077a319eda6fd2ddb9d8cecd88fca170891c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 18 May 2026 04:00:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(analyze): apply az-* design system to all bullet UI
 components
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- highlightResumeMetrics: swap inline <mark> styles for .az-metric class (amber bold)
- AnalyzeLiveResumeBody: score badges use .az-score-badge--weak/fair/strong; issue chips use .az-chips + .az-chip with max-3 + overflow pill; AI box is now .az-suggestion-card with ✦ header; all edit/accept buttons use .az-btn variants; accepted state shows full accepted text inline via .az-bullet-accepted-text
- AnnotatedResumePanel: legend replaced with compact .az-legend-pill + .az-legend-dot pills
- BulletImprovedEditor: textarea now uses .az-edit-textarea (neutral bg, Georgia serif, focus ring)

https://claude.ai/code/session_015ED4ARZAgLY1ww81cRfeDs
